<h1>Practical Scrum and Kanban estimation tips for better sprint forecasts</h1>

<p>If your team treats estimation like fortune telling with less flair you are not alone. Agile estimation and planning can be calm and useful instead of dramatic and expensive. This guide walks through preparing user stories choosing an estimation scale running planning poker and turning those numbers into a realistic backlog forecast with velocity or cycle time.</p>
